msgstr "ບໍລິການຖືກສ້າງແລ້ວ ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມ. ເລີ່ມມັນຈາກໜ້າບໍລິການ."

#: internal/modules/mongodb/mongodb.go:46 internal/modules/mysql/mysql.go:202
#: internal/modules/postgresql/postgresql.go:63
msgid ""
"Service is restarting. This may indicate a configuration error or a crash — "
"check the logs on the Services page."
msgstr ""
