msgid "Don't configure backups now - you can set this up later from Backups."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງບໍ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຕອນນີ້ - ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຍຫຼັງໄດ້ຈາກ Backups."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:540
msgid "Remote backups using the WebDAV protocol."
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທາງໄກໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄອນ WebDAV."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:541
msgid "Remote backups to another server via SSH/SFTP."
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄປຍັງເຊີບເວີອື່ນຜ່ານ SSH/SFTP."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:564
msgid "Block common attacks (SQL injection, XSS, and more) on new domains."
msgstr "ບລັອກການໂຈມຕີທົ່ວໄປ (SQL injection, XSS, ແລະອື່ນໆ) ໃສ່ໂດເມນໃໝ່."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:565
msgid "New domains get no request filtering."
msgstr "ໂດເມນໃໝ່ຈະບໍ່ມີການກັ່ນຕອງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍໃດໆ."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:652
#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:663
msgid ""
"No longer receives any patches - you should definitely plan an upgrade."
msgstr "ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບແພັດຊ໌ໃດໆອີກຕໍ່ໄປ - ທ່ານຄວນວາງແຜນອັບເກຣດຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:655
msgid ""
"The latest version - recommended for the newest features and performance."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນລ່າສຸດ - ແນະນຳສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະ ປະສິດທິພາບໃໝ່ລ່າສຸດ."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:658
msgid ""
"Security fixes only - fine for older apps, but you should plan an upgrade."
msgstr ""
"ແກ້ໄຂແຕ່ດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພເທົ່ານັ້ນ - ໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີກັບແອັບເກົ່າ, "
"ແຕ່ທ່ານຄວນວາງແຜນອັບເກຣດ."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:661
msgid ""
"Fully supported - use this if your apps aren't yet tested on the latest "
"version."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບເຕັມຮູບແບບ - "
"ໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ຖ້າແອັບຂອງທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກທົດສອບກັບເວີຊັນຫລ້າສຸດ."

